{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"632dd4147026fa600518a3f00c24b6fa8a338b17185b54576ae9104ec0242142","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":53,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["受苦的仆人"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["谁相信我们所传的呢？",{"text":"耶和华的臂膀向谁彰显呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂像嫩芽一样在耶和华面前长大，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像生长在旱地里的根。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂没有俊美威荣的外表吸引我们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也没有令我们仰慕的容貌。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂被藐视，遭人厌弃，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"饱受痛苦，历尽忧患。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人们对祂不屑一顾，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们也不尊重祂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"其实祂担当了我们的忧患，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"背负了我们的痛苦。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们却以为是上帝责罚、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"击打、苦待祂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁知祂是因我们的过犯而被刺透，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因我们的罪恶而被压伤。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们因祂所受的刑罚而得到平安，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因祂所受的鞭伤而得到医治。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们都像迷路的羊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"各人偏行己路，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但耶和华却让祂承担我们众人的罪恶。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂遭欺压、受痛苦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"却默然不语，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像被人牵去宰杀的羔羊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又如在剪毛人手下一声不吭的绵羊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂默然不语。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂受到欺压和审判，被押去处死。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂那个世代的人谁会想到祂受鞭打、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从世上被除去是因为我百姓的过犯呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"虽然祂没有做过残暴之事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"口中也没有诡诈，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人却将祂与恶人同葬，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"与富人同墓。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"然而，祂被压伤、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"受痛苦是耶和华的旨意；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的性命作了赎罪祭","poem":1},{"noteId":23},{"text":"。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必看见自己的后裔，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必长久活着。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华的旨意必在祂手中成就。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必看见自己劳苦的成果，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并心满意足。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华说：“我公义的仆人必凭祂的知识使许多人被算为义人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂要担当他们的罪恶。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，我要使祂与伟人同享尊荣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"跟强者同分战利品，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为祂献出了自己的生命。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂被列在罪犯中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"却担当了许多人的罪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又为罪犯代求。”","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":23,"caller":"+","text":"“祂的性命作了赎罪祭”或译“耶和华以祂的性命作赎罪祭”。","reference":{"chapter":53,"verse":10}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/53.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/54.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/52.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":12}